        "kind": "advice",
        "at": "2026",
        "text": "I had an empty Cornell campus to myself for months and almost no record of it. I wish I had taken the photos and flown the drone. What I did find was running, which I still have — so the year wasn't empty, it just left less behind than it should have. Document the strange stretches while you are inside them."
      },
